      },
      "replacement": "dataCollection",
      "replacementIds": ["dataCollection"],
      "requires": [
        "Remove sendDefaultPii. If it was true, the migration guide says the v11 default already matches and nothing else is needed.",
        "If it was false or unset, set dataCollection explicitly to the baseline in the migration guide. Left unset, v11 starts collecting cookies, HTTP bodies, database query data, queues and GenAI inputs and outputs, so this is a privacy change and not only a rename: say so in the PR.",
        "An empty dataCollection doesn't restore the old behaviour. Each category has to be turned off by name.",
        "On Astro, pass trackClientIp: false to keep client IPs out: it now follows dataCollection.userInfo, which defaults to true."
      ],
